(4913693, 714589, 60862, '<td valign="top">A nice idea.  I think it would''ve been stronger cropping out the tree trunk on the right.  It competes for my attention and leaves the left side feeling empty and unbalanced.  The bright leaves up and to the right also compete with the rider, whose tones don''t stand out much from the background.</td>', 'A nice idea.  I think it would''ve been stronger cropping out the tree trunk on the right.  It competes for my attention and leaves the left side feeling empty and unbalanced.  The bright leaves up and to the right also compete with the rider, whose tones don''t stand out much from the background.', '2008-08-27 01:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913700, 714313, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah, a figurative take.  Nicely composed.  The bright part of the back of his head pulls my attention away from the calm of his face.  But still, a nice shot.</td>', 'Ah, a figurative take.  Nicely composed.  The bright part of the back of his head pulls my attention away from the calm of his face.  But still, a nice shot.', '2008-08-27 01:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
