(4913714, 712518, 60862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, funny, and figurative!  That could be me - I spend hours staring up at the stars when I get the chance.</td>', 'Beautiful, funny, and figurative!  That could be me - I spend hours staring up at the stars when I get the chance.', '2008-08-27 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
