(4913858, 714648, 63503, '<td valign="top">I am assuming you did this using a pinhole in the center of the camera cap and hence the title, so, I''ll give you a 6 just for the effort. I am afraid most other voters will be less generous. I always wanted to try this but thought the image would be sharper.</td>', 'I am assuming you did this using a pinhole in the center of the camera cap and hence the title, so, I''ll give you a 6 just for the effort. I am afraid most other voters will be less generous. I always wanted to try this but thought the image would be sharper.', '2008-08-27 02:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
