(4913873, 713468, 60862, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t notice borders, but this is overly elaborate and takes away a lot of image area that could''ve added to the impact of the shot.</td>', 'I usually don''t notice borders, but this is overly elaborate and takes away a lot of image area that could''ve added to the impact of the shot.', '2008-08-27 02:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
