(4914103, 714521, 97840, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this was a good choice, it brings focus into the middle of the picture which is the center point of picture. Thats very important you don''t ever want your viewer to look somewhere first than what your intention was.</td>', 'The lighting on this was a good choice, it brings focus into the middle of the picture which is the center point of picture. Thats very important you don''t ever want your viewer to look somewhere first than what your intention was.', '2008-08-27 03:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
