(4914145, 714676, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The land portion of the picture is a bit too dark for me, BTW my monitor is calibrated. Being that Shadows and highlights is legal in basic editing I would have liked a bit more light to the foreground.<br/>Great image anyway, I am giving you an 8. Why does the guy look transparent? was he there for only half the time? did you purposely go for the ghost effect?</td>', 'Great capture. The land portion of the picture is a bit too dark for me, BTW my monitor is calibrated. Being that Shadows and highlights is legal in basic editing I would have liked a bit more light to the foreground.Great image anyway, I am giving you an 8. Why does the guy look transparent? was he there for only half the time? did you purposely go for the ghost effect?', '2008-08-27 03:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
