(4916345, 713445, 97192, '<td valign="top">I am impressed with the creative thought put into this beautiful and abstract piece of art. This work is a welcome tangent to the tedious and uninteresting snapshots of dusty old roads or calm streams. For those of you unperceptive enough to take note of the inanimate man appearing to leap over the violently thrashing waters beneath, this image certainly does portray that of a road (which can also refer to a path, or a means of arriving to a destination, including aqueous mediums) which one would not want to frequently travel. I applaud this refreshingly original piece, and do not doubt that the beauty of this fine piece reflects that of the photgrapher''s mind.</td>', 'I am impressed with the creative thought put into this beautiful and abstract piece of art. This work is a welcome tangent to the tedious and uninteresting snapshots of dusty old roads or calm streams. For those of you unperceptive enough to take note of the inanimate man appearing to leap over the violently thrashing waters beneath, this image certainly does portray that of a road (which can also refer to a path, or a means of arriving to a destination, including aqueous mediums) which one would not want to frequently travel. I applaud this refreshingly original piece, and do not doubt that the beauty of this fine piece reflects that of the photgrapher''s mind.', '2008-08-27 20:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916348, 713645, 69109, '<td valign="top">Very strong photograph, full of humanity, full of sense...</td>', 'Very strong photograph, full of humanity, full of sense...', '2008-08-27 20:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916350, 714517, 97192, '<td valign="top">Interesting background</td>', 'Interesting background', '2008-08-27 20:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916355, 714029, 97192, '<td valign="top">The stagnant stream really accentuates the lack of use of this road.</td>', 'The stagnant stream really accentuates the lack of use of this road.', '2008-08-27 20:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916357, 714340, 97192, '<td valign="top">This seems like an attempt to find a use for an old picture you found on your computer...</td>', 'This seems like an attempt to find a use for an old picture you found on your computer...', '2008-08-27 20:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916358, 714249, 97192, '<td valign="top">Irrelevant, but a nice picture nontheless</td>', 'Irrelevant, but a nice picture nontheless', '2008-08-27 20:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916361, 713468, 97192, '<td valign="top">I am a huge fan of ancient architecture, and the small building near the back gives this photo the appearance of an unfrequented area.</td>', 'I am a huge fan of ancient architecture, and the small building near the back gives this photo the appearance of an unfrequented area.', '2008-08-27 20:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916619, 714554, 80706, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I like the infrared feel.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I like the infrared feel.', '2008-08-27 22:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916663, 712851, 39632, '<td valign="top">My pick for winner, awesome shot.</td>', 'My pick for winner, awesome shot.', '2008-08-27 22:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916667, 713414, 60224, '<td valign="top">Cool shot...not sure about the road less traveled plays here...but I love old cars!!</td>', 'Cool shot...not sure about the road less traveled plays here...but I love old cars!!', '2008-08-27 22:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916673, 713437, 60224, '<td valign="top">Flat and blah for me.</td>', 'Flat and blah for me.', '2008-08-27 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916674, 714526, 60224, '<td valign="top">Cool effect!</td>', 'Cool effect!', '2008-08-27 22:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916678, 714195, 60224, '<td valign="top">Crazy colors! Love it.</td>', 'Crazy colors! Love it.', '2008-08-27 22:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916725, 714498, 7565, '<td valign="top">Ha! Very amusing photo. It''s creative and slightly morbid, nicely done!</td>', 'Ha! Very amusing photo. It''s creative and slightly morbid, nicely done!', '2008-08-27 23:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916761, 712518, 94265, '<td valign="top">My fave to win.</td>', 'My fave to win.', '2008-08-27 23:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916833, 714163, 96881, '<td valign="top">I think the colours are a little overdone.  The blue and greens are no longer real looking and the definition in the clouds has been lost.  I am not a fan of Over-processed photos where the colours are no longer real.</td>', 'I think the colours are a little overdone.  The blue and greens are no longer real looking and the definition in the clouds has been lost.  I am not a fan of Over-processed photos where the colours are no longer real.', '2008-08-27 23:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916842, 713379, 96881, '<td valign="top">This photo appears oput of focus.  Need a much greater depth of field on the photo.  Increase your aperture, especially when the focus point is close to keep much of the background close to focus.  In focus, this shot would have scored much higher from me.</td>', 'This photo appears oput of focus.  Need a much greater depth of field on the photo.  Increase your aperture, especially when the focus point is close to keep much of the background close to focus.  In focus, this shot would have scored much higher from me.', '2008-08-27 23:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916845, 714340, 96881, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture of the two jets.  It appears reasonably sharp and the colours look great.<br/>Struggling to really see the connection to the Challenge though.</td>', 'Terrific capture of the two jets.  It appears reasonably sharp and the colours look great.Struggling to really see the connection to the Challenge though.', '2008-08-27 23:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916847, 714564, 96881, '<td valign="top">Needs a greater depth of field.  Increase your aperture in my opinion.  The grass and road so out of focus in the foreground takes away from the photo.  If the foreground was closer to focus, would have scored much higher.</td>', 'Needs a greater depth of field.  Increase your aperture in my opinion.  The grass and road so out of focus in the foreground takes away from the photo.  If the foreground was closer to focus, would have scored much higher.', '2008-08-27 23:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916852, 714125, 96881, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of this post processing.  Would have preferred to have seen the original.  I struggle to work out what you are trying to do with this, hard to pick out the road.  The effect does not work for me.</td>', 'I am not a fan of this post processing.  Would have preferred to have seen the original.  I struggle to work out what you are trying to do with this, hard to pick out the road.  The effect does not work for me.', '2008-08-27 23:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916864, 714108, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, do not like the crop, especially with the truck and the car half in the photo.  Some extra part of the main road I think would have worked better, or remove the road altogether and have a square photo with just the side road.  The road being partly in takes away from it.</td>', 'I like the idea, do not like the crop, especially with the truck and the car half in the photo.  Some extra part of the main road I think would have worked better, or remove the road altogether and have a square photo with just the side road.  The road being partly in takes away from it.', '2008-08-28 00:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916869, 714029, 96881, '<td valign="top">For me, the idea is great, the women and her dog are too far away though.  If they were closer, then it would fit.  The women and her dog opposite the bench would probably have worked really well, but that far away, with the glare, they are hard to see.  Would have been better to have it without the women then where she it.</td>', 'For me, the idea is great, the women and her dog are too far away though.  If they were closer, then it would fit.  The women and her dog opposite the bench would probably have worked really well, but that far away, with the glare, they are hard to see.  Would have been better to have it without the women then where she it.', '2008-08-28 00:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916872, 714313, 96881, '<td valign="top">A nice and different take on the challenge.  Well executed photo.  I like the black background, it makes him and the white colour stand out more.</td>', 'A nice and different take on the challenge.  Well executed photo.  I like the black background, it makes him and the white colour stand out more.', '2008-08-28 00:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916878, 714317, 96881, '<td valign="top">Sorry, for me DNMC.  Can''t see how this fits.<br/>However, ignoring that, the photo looks sharp, depth of field is about right.</td>', 'Sorry, for me DNMC.  Can''t see how this fits.However, ignoring that, the photo looks sharp, depth of field is about right.', '2008-08-28 00:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916883, 714463, 96881, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see better Post Processing.  The idea for the photo is good, the composition is fine, but the blue sky and especially the trees/bushes are washed out.  Adjusting the colours on the blue and green channels would have made this photo much better</td>', 'I would have liked to see better Post Processing.  The idea for the photo is good, the composition is fine, but the blue sky and especially the trees/bushes are washed out.  Adjusting the colours on the blue and green channels would have made this photo much better', '2008-08-28 00:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916890, 714597, 96881, '<td valign="top">A different take on the challenge.  Congrats for being brave.<br/>I like it and like the idea.</td>', 'A different take on the challenge.  Congrats for being brave.I like it and like the idea.', '2008-08-28 00:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916898, 714465, 96881, '<td valign="top">Would have loved some post processing as the colours to me appear washed out and a little boring.  A little PP work could have made this photo stand out.</td>', 'Would have loved some post processing as the colours to me appear washed out and a little boring.  A little PP work could have made this photo stand out.', '2008-08-28 00:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916905, 713468, 96881, '<td valign="top">Love the border, it works (others might bag you but).  Photo composition is great.  Meets the challenge without being boring.  Road leads to an interesting topic.  Light is great, road in shadow, ruins in light.<br/>A touch of green maybe to boost the trees/hills perhaps???<br/>Great submission though</td>', 'Love the border, it works (others might bag you but).  Photo composition is great.  Meets the challenge without being boring.  Road leads to an interesting topic.  Light is great, road in shadow, ruins in light.A touch of green maybe to boost the trees/hills perhaps???Great submission though', '2008-08-28 00:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916914, 714648, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not for me.  Don''t like the out of focus shot.  Just looks like a mess.</td>', 'Not for me.  Don''t like the out of focus shot.  Just looks like a mess.', '2008-08-28 00:23:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4916917, 714390, 96881, '<td valign="top">I don''t think there is enough sky in this.  Some more sky would have added to the photo, just for the framing</td>', 'I don''t think there is enough sky in this.  Some more sky would have added to the photo, just for the framing', '2008-08-28 00:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916928, 714508, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great Photo, would have preferred to see it as a photo instead of the overprocessed look you have gone for.  The composition is great, the idea also, but I am not a fan of this look</td>', 'Great Photo, would have preferred to see it as a photo instead of the overprocessed look you have gone for.  The composition is great, the idea also, but I am not a fan of this look', '2008-08-28 00:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916931, 712512, 96881, '<td valign="top">Basic, well executed, meets the challenge and the black and white works, well done</td>', 'Basic, well executed, meets the challenge and the black and white works, well done', '2008-08-28 00:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916950, 714526, 96881, '<td valign="top">Now that my eyes have stopped going mad.<br/>Great Capture.  you really have captured the movement well (hence my eyes).  The car is brilliantly in focus while the out of focus trees give the impression almost that the car is moving in the photo, and that you are watching it move.<br/>However, not quite convinced about it being less travelled, however, still good marks for the great execution.</td>', 'Now that my eyes have stopped going mad.Great Capture.  you really have captured the movement well (hence my eyes).  The car is brilliantly in focus while the out of focus trees give the impression almost that the car is moving in the photo, and that you are watching it move.However, not quite convinced about it being less travelled, however, still good marks for the great execution.', '2008-08-28 00:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4916955, 714314, 96881, '<td valign="top">This photo appears out of focus and noisy (to me)  Maybe it is the post processing.  Whatever it is, i would have preferred to see this as a black and white photo of what could have been a very interesting forest road.</td>', 'This photo appears out of focus and noisy (to me)  Maybe it is the post processing.  Whatever it is, i would have preferred to see this as a black and white photo of what could have been a very interesting forest road.', '2008-08-28 00:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4917118, 713239, 83650, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a shot that is not quite so literal.  I *get* it. ;-)</td>', 'Nice to see a shot that is not quite so literal.  I *get* it. ;-)', '2008-08-28 01:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4917138, 713588, 83650, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time seeing a literal or figurative role this flower has with "highway."  Plus, I''m not too keen on it being an almost identical but flipped image of MaryO''s ribbon winner.</td>', 'I''m having a hard time seeing a literal or figurative role this flower has with "highway."  Plus, I''m not too keen on it being an almost identical but flipped image of MaryO''s ribbon winner.', '2008-08-28 01:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4917147, 713240, 83650, '<td valign="top">I honestly believe this shot could have been in medal contention, but there''s something that seems to be muddying the details.  Might be the focus, lens is too soft, or a rather large aperture was used.  Can''t quite tell.</td>', 'I honestly believe this shot could have been in medal contention, but there''s something that seems to be muddying the details.  Might be the focus, lens is too soft, or a rather large aperture was used.  Can''t quite tell.', '2008-08-28 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
