(4921500, 714380, 62187, '<td valign="top">Why do I think this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=71558" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">patsfan</a>? Anyway, I do think your on the right track. Very ironic: button-up shirt, slacks and a briefcase in the middle of the woods. Too funny! Great idea and the composition is perfect. Bumping from 8 to 10.</td>', 'Why do I think this is  patsfan? Anyway, I do think your on the right track. Very ironic: button-up shirt, slacks and a briefcase in the middle of the woods. Too funny! Great idea and the composition is perfect. Bumping from 8 to 10.', '2008-08-30 13:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
