(4923605, 712862, 26001, '<td valign="top">absolutely stunning! the photo conveys less traveled road without showing any road. would have been perfect for the currently running "overexposed" challenge too. 10</td>', 'absolutely stunning! the photo conveys less traveled road without showing any road. would have been perfect for the currently running "overexposed" challenge too. 10', '2008-08-31 21:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
