(4925940, 714098, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I feel the picture sits awkwardly in the frame, it''s far too heavy on the left side but with distraction on the right so my eyes tend to dart around in the frame without stopping anywhere.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I feel the picture sits awkwardly in the frame, it''s far too heavy on the left side but with distraction on the right so my eyes tend to dart around in the frame without stopping anywhere.', '2008-09-01 15:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
