(4925954, 714657, 96721, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, not sure the tyre tracks really add to the feeling of "A Road less travelled" but the dead end sign certainly helps pull it back to within the literal definition of the theme<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'I like this shot, not sure the tyre tracks really add to the feeling of "A Road less travelled" but the dead end sign certainly helps pull it back to within the literal definition of the theme 6', '2008-09-01 15:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
