(4925963, 713239, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the theme, I personally think a plain white dress would have added a bit more impact in the shot and given a bit more definition to the flowers - over all though I like this one.<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Nice take on the theme, I personally think a plain white dress would have added a bit more impact in the shot and given a bit more definition to the flowers - over all though I like this one. 6', '2008-09-01 15:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
