(4929083, 713979, 97852, '<td valign="top">Nice Photograph.  I noticed there is a person just left and maybe a head just above the lounger.  Was this intentional?  I''d like to see all of the chair''s shadow.  Just nitpickin''.  I did give you an 8.  Good one.</td>', 'Nice Photograph.  I noticed there is a person just left and maybe a head just above the lounger.  Was this intentional?  I''d like to see all of the chair''s shadow.  Just nitpickin''.  I did give you an 8.  Good one.', '2008-09-02 22:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929084, 712862, 97852, '<td valign="top">Unusual positioning.  But it made me look twice.  I really like the shot.</td>', 'Unusual positioning.  But it made me look twice.  I really like the shot.', '2008-09-02 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929087, 714655, 97852, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I would have positioned myself to the left or right a bit for more of an angled perspective.  Background trees and shrubs seem a bit out of focus - Maybe open up more for better hyperfocal distance.  Either way, I like it.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I would have positioned myself to the left or right a bit for more of an angled perspective.  Background trees and shrubs seem a bit out of focus - Maybe open up more for better hyperfocal distance.  Either way, I like it.', '2008-09-02 22:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929114, 712518, 2333, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured! Love the cloud movement; adds a nice dynamic element to the composition.</td>', 'Nicely captured! Love the cloud movement; adds a nice dynamic element to the composition.', '2008-09-02 22:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929132, 714648, 84520, '<td valign="top">I always like literal, tongue in cheek responses to challenges.  This certainly is the ''road less traveled''! <br/> <br/>You get a 10 from me, and Ill be damned if this doesnt win</td>', 'I always like literal, tongue in cheek responses to challenges.  This certainly is the ''road less traveled''!  You get a 10 from me, and Ill be damned if this doesnt win', '2008-09-02 22:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929137, 714463, 2333, '<td valign="top">Did you know there is only one intersection of entrepreneur and boundary rd in North America? At least according to Streets &amp; Trips!</td>', 'Did you know there is only one intersection of entrepreneur and boundary rd in North America? At least according to Streets & Trips!', '2008-09-02 22:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929152, 712851, 84520, '<td valign="top">Sick vista.  It probably would have worked better to have NO cars on the ''road less traveled'' but it isnt a perfect world :)<br/> <br/>-7</td>', 'Sick vista.  It probably would have worked better to have NO cars on the ''road less traveled'' but it isnt a perfect world :) -7', '2008-09-02 23:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929261, 714356, 60658, '<td valign="top">While this is a road, it does not appear to be less traveled... I see atleast 1 car on it... If I am missing the connection I apologize.  Look forward to the info regarding this shot post-voting.</td>', 'While this is a road, it does not appear to be less traveled... I see atleast 1 car on it... If I am missing the connection I apologize.  Look forward to the info regarding this shot post-voting.', '2008-09-02 23:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929266, 714609, 60658, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing, color is a little flat, not sure if it is because of the expanse of gray.</td>', 'Interesting framing, color is a little flat, not sure if it is because of the expanse of gray.', '2008-09-02 23:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929279, 713445, 60658, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the statute would have looked like in the image, but it would likely explain the point/theme to which your title refers (I do get your photo though!)?  Way to challenge the literalites in using their imagination.</td>', 'Not sure what the statute would have looked like in the image, but it would likely explain the point/theme to which your title refers (I do get your photo though!)?  Way to challenge the literalites in using their imagination.', '2008-09-02 23:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929297, 713240, 60658, '<td valign="top">Looks like the idea is there, the execution is missing a little ooomp for me.  Not sure if its color or contrast my eye (subjectively speaking) wants, the light through the trees looks like it probably gave you fits in metering this though!</td>', 'Looks like the idea is there, the execution is missing a little ooomp for me.  Not sure if its color or contrast my eye (subjectively speaking) wants, the light through the trees looks like it probably gave you fits in metering this though!', '2008-09-03 00:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929314, 714433, 60658, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell if this is intentionally desaturated, not against the idea, but personally would like to see some more motion/feeling with the dog (who is good looking and appears to have definition and strong lines).  Although, getting him/her to cooperate is likely easier said than done!</td>', 'Can''t tell if this is intentionally desaturated, not against the idea, but personally would like to see some more motion/feeling with the dog (who is good looking and appears to have definition and strong lines).  Although, getting him/her to cooperate is likely easier said than done!', '2008-09-03 00:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929331, 714625, 60658, '<td valign="top">Good idea, lineup of canoes visually interesting (although people on left somewhat distracting.  When composing the image I would have exposed for the bright sky to preserve blue and lifted the exposure of the dark areas.  Also, I was not there, so this may not have been possible.  Take comment accordingly!</td>', 'Good idea, lineup of canoes visually interesting (although people on left somewhat distracting.  When composing the image I would have exposed for the bright sky to preserve blue and lifted the exposure of the dark areas.  Also, I was not there, so this may not have been possible.  Take comment accordingly!', '2008-09-03 00:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929339, 714029, 60658, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this image, but like you, I struggle with dealing with haze in post processing.  As a result the image lacks the depth that I am sure you saw on site.  Good job though!</td>', 'I like the idea of this image, but like you, I struggle with dealing with haze in post processing.  As a result the image lacks the depth that I am sure you saw on site.  Good job though!', '2008-09-03 00:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929384, 713500, 60658, '<td valign="top">I like the color, framing, and simplicity. However, a relatively new looking sign does not denote a road, actual or methaphorical, less traveled.</td>', 'I like the color, framing, and simplicity. However, a relatively new looking sign does not denote a road, actual or methaphorical, less traveled.', '2008-09-03 00:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929389, 714391, 60658, '<td valign="top">I like that you went a little different with the b&amp;w.  Overall the image does not raise any feeling in me, good or bad.  Not sure what''s causing this, maybe the framing?!?...</td>', 'I like that you went a little different with the b&w.  Overall the image does not raise any feeling in me, good or bad.  Not sure what''s causing this, maybe the framing?!?...', '2008-09-03 00:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929396, 712861, 60658, '<td valign="top">Good image.  Looks like you are dealing with the same issue that I do, haze!  Good depth to the foreground, but the background is a little flat.  Keep it up!</td>', 'Good image.  Looks like you are dealing with the same issue that I do, haze!  Good depth to the foreground, but the background is a little flat.  Keep it up!', '2008-09-03 00:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929413, 714430, 60658, '<td valign="top">Nice thought for the challenge.  The left of the image is a little distracting, maybe a little earlier in the day to light up the barn/house so you could also see the color there.  Saturation is a bit unatural as you can see around the roof of the barn.  Keep shooting!</td>', 'Nice thought for the challenge.  The left of the image is a little distracting, maybe a little earlier in the day to light up the barn/house so you could also see the color there.  Saturation is a bit unatural as you can see around the roof of the barn.  Keep shooting!', '2008-09-03 00:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929433, 714565, 60658, '<td valign="top">Like what you are going for with the natural lighting and low angle.  The front branch detracts from the light you waited so patiently for.  As someone is learning too, experiment with various apertures to see how it would look (I am working on the same thing). Keep shooting!</td>', 'Like what you are going for with the natural lighting and low angle.  The front branch detracts from the light you waited so patiently for.  As someone is learning too, experiment with various apertures to see how it would look (I am working on the same thing). Keep shooting!', '2008-09-03 00:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929438, 714524, 60658, '<td valign="top">Low angle and road are interesting.  Image may be better with the natural warmth of sunset or haze/dew/dreariness of a sunrise.</td>', 'Low angle and road are interesting.  Image may be better with the natural warmth of sunset or haze/dew/dreariness of a sunrise.', '2008-09-03 00:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929444, 714215, 60658, '<td valign="top">Way to think outside the road! I would suggest waiting a few more seconds for the houses to be outside the frame.  Subject seems to be a little soft, but the color on the chute is nice.</td>', 'Way to think outside the road! I would suggest waiting a few more seconds for the houses to be outside the frame.  Subject seems to be a little soft, but the color on the chute is nice.', '2008-09-03 00:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929460, 714648, 50641, '<td valign="top">congrats!!!</td>', 'congrats!!!', '2008-09-03 01:02:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929470, 712851, 7810, '<td valign="top">Congrats Joe!!!<br/> <br/>Great idea great result!</td>', 'Congrats Joe!!! Great idea great result!', '2008-09-03 01:04:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929488, 712862, 7810, '<td valign="top">Congrats Lesley<br/> <br/>A sweet minimalistic masterpiece!!!</td>', 'Congrats Lesley A sweet minimalistic masterpiece!!!', '2008-09-03 01:07:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929493, 712518, 39427, '<td valign="top">i loved this shot, and love seeing it on the front page.  Sick, congrats on your 1st ribbon.</td>', 'i loved this shot, and love seeing it on the front page.  Sick, congrats on your 1st ribbon.', '2008-09-03 01:07:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929499, 714498, 67579, '<td valign="top">This was just plain awesome Art!! I thought this mite be yours lol. High five buddy :)</td>', 'This was just plain awesome Art!! I thought this mite be yours lol. High five buddy :)', '2008-09-03 01:08:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929500, 712851, 39427, '<td valign="top">So awesome, Joe!  I knew this would win.  Congrats again.</td>', 'So awesome, Joe!  I knew this would win.  Congrats again.', '2008-09-03 01:08:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929501, 712862, 33068, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2008-09-03 01:09:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929511, 712518, 28322, '<td valign="top">Seriously I pisses me off to see such a wonderful photo get 6 votes 3 and less, <br/>It would kill the score, fortunately it didn`t do that in your case, but it still pisses me off `` excuse my French ``. <br/>Congratulation on a very well deserved award, and for those 6 Photogs .. well I am sure they got the message, <br/>Cheers,</td>', 'Seriously I pisses me off to see such a wonderful photo get 6 votes 3 and less, It would kill the score, fortunately it didn`t do that in your case, but it still pisses me off `` excuse my French ``. Congratulation on a very well deserved award, and for those 6 Photogs .. well I am sure they got the message, Cheers,', '2008-09-03 01:10:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929524, 712851, 42013, '<td valign="top">Wow Joe! Congrats on this fab shot. very dizzying.</td>', 'Wow Joe! Congrats on this fab shot. very dizzying.', '2008-09-03 01:10:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929533, 713647, 42013, '<td valign="top">Your mind continues to amaze. Sweet work and very mystical!</td>', 'Your mind continues to amaze. Sweet work and very mystical!', '2008-09-03 01:12:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929537, 714648, 30982, '<td valign="top">One of the coolest browns in a long time!!  Excellent!</td>', 'One of the coolest browns in a long time!!  Excellent!', '2008-09-03 01:12:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929543, 714465, 15291, '<td valign="top">Well thank you all for the comments &amp; votes I finally got to the goal of getting at least a 5 in a challange and it is a personal best. We will keep putting one foot in front of the other and try to set a new personal best next time out. Thanks again to all of you.</td>', 'Well thank you all for the comments & votes I finally got to the goal of getting at least a 5 in a challange and it is a personal best. We will keep putting one foot in front of the other and try to set a new personal best next time out. Thanks again to all of you.', '2008-09-03 01:13:24.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4929552, 713647, 73452, '<td valign="top">another remarkable and inspiring shot Coley, and congradulations on the 4th, you deserve it ten-fold.</td>', 'another remarkable and inspiring shot Coley, and congradulations on the 4th, you deserve it ten-fold.', '2008-09-03 01:14:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929556, 712518, 73980, '<td valign="top">I agree, the 6 people who voted 1/2/3 need to reassess what they are doing here... guarantee their photos are somewhere in the nosebleed section.<br/> <br/>excellent job!  congrats on the blue!</td>', 'I agree, the 6 people who voted 1/2/3 need to reassess what they are doing here... guarantee their photos are somewhere in the nosebleed section. excellent job!  congrats on the blue!', '2008-09-03 01:15:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929566, 712851, 73980, '<td valign="top">Phew!  excellent job!  congrats on your red!</td>', 'Phew!  excellent job!  congrats on your red!', '2008-09-03 01:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929582, 714133, 60658, '<td valign="top">Was out of town and didn''t get to finish commenting, but I want to commend you for stepping outside the box.  My advice (having done a non-traditional entry for this challenge as well) is to make sure your image speaks to the theme of the challenge without having a title - don''t make the literalites think.  That being said - shoot for yourself!</td>', 'Was out of town and didn''t get to finish commenting, but I want to commend you for stepping outside the box.  My advice (having done a non-traditional entry for this challenge as well) is to make sure your image speaks to the theme of the challenge without having a title - don''t make the literalites think.  That being said - shoot for yourself!', '2008-09-03 01:19:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929611, 712862, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh YEAH - just where it belongs on the front page - you ROCK!</td>', 'Oh YEAH - just where it belongs on the front page - you ROCK!', '2008-09-03 01:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929623, 712862, 68980, '<td valign="top">cool :)</td>', 'cool :)', '2008-09-03 01:24:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929629, 713500, 58728, '<td valign="top">Interesting score.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but if I had, I would have given this an 8.  The colors are great, composition and focus is wonderful, and the image makes you think.  I am VERy surprised it didn''t do better.  Perhaps people didn''t "get it"?  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Interesting score.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but if I had, I would have given this an 8.  The colors are great, composition and focus is wonderful, and the image makes you think.  I am VERy surprised it didn''t do better.  Perhaps people didn''t "get it"?   ', '2008-09-03 01:25:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929631, 712862, 58728, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Congrats on your ribbon.  It''s a lovely image.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Congrats on your ribbon.  It''s a lovely image.', '2008-09-03 01:25:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929640, 713239, 93478, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the great results for your first challenge.  I''m happy to see your originality rewarded.</td>', 'Congratulations on the great results for your first challenge.  I''m happy to see your originality rewarded.', '2008-09-03 01:27:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929644, 712851, 8891, '<td valign="top">Many congrats on your Red, Joe! Great shot!</td>', 'Many congrats on your Red, Joe! Great shot!', '2008-09-03 01:27:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929683, 712862, 49643, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the win with this beautiful image!</td>', 'Congratulations on the win with this beautiful image!', '2008-09-03 01:36:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929688, 712862, 60862, '<td valign="top">Oh, so clever!  What''s "less travelled" than non-existent. :)  Congrats on this very atypical ribbon-winning shot!</td>', 'Oh, so clever!  What''s "less travelled" than non-existent. :)  Congrats on this very atypical ribbon-winning shot!', '2008-09-03 01:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929692, 712851, 52336, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Joe, very nice!</td>', 'Congratulations Joe, very nice!', '2008-09-03 01:38:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929696, 712851, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Joe!</td>', 'Congrats, Joe!', '2008-09-03 01:39:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929700, 712862, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautifully minimal and effective - lovely work, Les!</td>', 'Beautifully minimal and effective - lovely work, Les!', '2008-09-03 01:39:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929701, 712862, 37430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love the way subject covers only a minor part of whole composition and still dominates it! Congratulations on the ribbon!</td>', 'Beautiful! Love the way subject covers only a minor part of whole composition and still dominates it! Congratulations on the ribbon!', '2008-09-03 01:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929715, 712851, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m happy to see this do so well. Congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'I''m happy to see this do so well. Congrats on your ribbon.', '2008-09-03 01:42:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929726, 712518, 30861, '<td valign="top">Good to see this do so well :-) Earlier comment stands...</td>', 'Good to see this do so well :-) Earlier comment stands...', '2008-09-03 01:44:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929730, 712518, 50591, '<td valign="top">My first ribbon, thanks! Granted, its only my second entry ever, but still, thanks.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-03 00:56:11.</i></td>', 'My first ribbon, thanks! Granted, its only my second entry ever, but still, thanks.', '2008-09-03 01:44:31.000000', '2008-09-03 01:56:11.000000', 0),
