(4929757, 712862, 28742, '<td valign="top">Two more words: CONGRATULATIONS! :)</td>', 'Two more words: CONGRATULATIONS! :)', '2008-09-03 01:49:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929760, 712862, 52549, '<td valign="top">WTG, Lesley. This definitely belongs on the front page, it''s so subtle and interesting. Congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'WTG, Lesley. This definitely belongs on the front page, it''s so subtle and interesting. Congrats on your ribbon.', '2008-09-03 01:49:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929763, 712862, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice work, Lesley! I''m glad the voters saw beyond the obvious and graced this lovely image with a ribbon.</td>', 'Nice work, Lesley! I''m glad the voters saw beyond the obvious and graced this lovely image with a ribbon.', '2008-09-03 01:49:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929767, 712518, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the personal best and your first of many ribbons to come!</td>', 'Congrats on the personal best and your first of many ribbons to come!', '2008-09-03 01:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929779, 714597, 61818, '<td valign="top">Bad crop, bad lighting, boring subject, subject not overtly related to a ''road'' in the literal sense, religious props attract low votes like dog poo attracts flies.<br/> <br/>While it''s a shame that only a literal representation of a road seemed to have a chance of doing well in the challenge, you should take a look at any of the top 10 shots and list out what it is you like about them and in what ways they differ from this shot.  That exercise will teach you quite a bit and your next entry will no doubt benefit from it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-03 00:53:22.</i></td>', 'Bad crop, bad lighting, boring subject, subject not overtly related to a ''road'' in the literal sense, religious props attract low votes like dog poo attracts flies. While it''s a shame that only a literal representation of a road seemed to have a chance of doing well in the challenge, you should take a look at any of the top 10 shots and list out what it is you like about them and in what ways they differ from this shot.  That exercise will teach you quite a bit and your next entry will no doubt benefit from it.', '2008-09-03 01:53:00.000000', '2008-09-03 01:53:22.000000', 0),
(4929790, 712862, 60915, '<td valign="top">cool! : ) Congrats Les!!! : )</td>', 'cool! : ) Congrats Les!!! : )', '2008-09-03 01:55:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929795, 712851, 60915, '<td valign="top">Nice to see you on the front page, man!!! Congrats on the <strike>red</strike>  blue Joe!! : )<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-04 04:54:18.</i></td>', 'Nice to see you on the front page, man!!! Congrats on the red  blue Joe!! : )', '2008-09-03 01:56:39.000000', '2008-09-04 05:54:18.000000', 0),
(4929802, 714597, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wow, your metaphor came in even under mine! We are both misunderstood <i>artistes</i>. This didn''t come up for me in voting, though I did look at it when browsing the images right after the starting rollover. I definitely got the metaphor, but then my own was also misunderstood. (Perhaps it was that my sign implied the <i>existence</i> of a road that it came in a touch higher?)<br/> <br/>As far as the image itself, I think it''s decent, and the shallow DOF guides one''s eye to the passage on the page. As violinist suggested, religious messages may not always go over well here, and though it''s actually a pretty decent shot, it doesn''t have any "wow" factor.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-03 01:02:15.</i></td>', 'Wow, your metaphor came in even under mine! We are both misunderstood artistes. This didn''t come up for me in voting, though I did look at it when browsing the images right after the starting rollover. I definitely got the metaphor, but then my own was also misunderstood. (Perhaps it was that my sign implied the existence of a road that it came in a touch higher?) As far as the image itself, I think it''s decent, and the shallow DOF guides one''s eye to the passage on the page. As violinist suggested, religious messages may not always go over well here, and though it''s actually a pretty decent shot, it doesn''t have any "wow" factor.', '2008-09-03 01:57:59.000000', '2008-09-03 02:02:15.000000', 0),
(4929805, 714648, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I love the sentiment, if not quite the photo (and you know how much I love your imagery).<br/> <br/>But tell ya what:  you bring this plateless thing to the DC GTG on Sept. 13, and I''ll use it for a photo. :)</td>', 'Ha!  I love the sentiment, if not quite the photo (and you know how much I love your imagery). But tell ya what:  you bring this plateless thing to the DC GTG on Sept. 13, and I''ll use it for a photo. :)', '2008-09-03 01:58:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929814, 712862, 82707, '<td valign="top">A truely beautiful image!  Congrats on a well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'A truely beautiful image!  Congrats on a well deserved ribbon!', '2008-09-03 02:00:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929822, 712862, 80167, '<td valign="top">This is a phenomenal shot! I couldn''t agree more with everyone else''s negative space comments.<br/> <br/>How''d you get the overexposed look without overexposing the subjects using only basic editing? I''ve been trying to get this look using only basic for quite some time now and have had no luck... it couldn''t hurt for the overexposed challenge right now, either. ;)</td>', 'This is a phenomenal shot! I couldn''t agree more with everyone else''s negative space comments. How''d you get the overexposed look without overexposing the subjects using only basic editing? I''ve been trying to get this look using only basic for quite some time now and have had no luck... it couldn''t hurt for the overexposed challenge right now, either. ;)', '2008-09-03 02:03:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4929824, 714451, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ok, how did YOUR metaphor break the 5 barrier? Probably would have hit a high 5 or a 6 if not for all the metaphors without roads getting lowballed.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-03 01:06:06.</i></td>', 'Ok, how did YOUR metaphor break the 5 barrier? Probably would have hit a high 5 or a 6 if not for all the metaphors without roads getting lowballed.', '2008-09-03 02:04:20.000000', '2008-09-03 02:06:06.000000', 0),
