(4950765, 713239, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh WOW - I love this and aren''t you lucky you have such a beautiful model - GRIN!<br/> <br/>I think you might find that it''s a bit dark, but that''s a really good score when you look at the spread - 5 10''s and 5 9''s is wonderful!<br/> <br/>Perhaps a little tweaking with ''Brightness/Contrast''.  But I think this is great!</td>', 'Oh WOW - I love this and aren''t you lucky you have such a beautiful model - GRIN! I think you might find that it''s a bit dark, but that''s a really good score when you look at the spread - 5 10''s and 5 9''s is wonderful! Perhaps a little tweaking with ''Brightness/Contrast''.  But I think this is great!', '2008-09-11 18:19:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4960144, 714133, 30982, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote this challenge, but this one did catch my eye when I perused the entries one afternoon.  I thought it quite appropriate for the challenge, though it did rely on the title a bit.  I think it works well in B&amp;W and has enough contrast, too.</td>', 'I didn''t vote this challenge, but this one did catch my eye when I perused the entries one afternoon.  I thought it quite appropriate for the challenge, though it did rely on the title a bit.  I think it works well in B&W and has enough contrast, too.', '2008-09-17 14:58:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4965105, 713528, 89341, '<td valign="top">great colours and patterns of the wooden wheel</td>', 'great colours and patterns of the wooden wheel', '2008-09-19 22:39:51.000000', NULL, 0),
